LDAC encoder from Android Open Source Project (Sony Corporation).

Upstream: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/external/libldac
Revision: eeee1a3f5f8df1282e3a6d297085885fd886737b
License: Apache-2.0; see LICENSE and NOTICE.

The Bluetooth media add-on builds src/ldaclib.c and src/ldacBT.c, which include
the remaining implementation files. Haiku adds ldacBT_set_bitrate() so the
output node can select lower frame lengths such as 128 and 256 kb/s. Only the
encoder is provided by this library.
